# The submissions are compared byte for byte (task 2 step 04 and step 09, sha1 of the task 1 file), so the
# data and submission files must keep LF line endings on every platform, Windows included. Without this, a
# Windows checkout rewrites them as CRLF and the self-checks report a difference that does not exist.
*.csv     text eol=lf
*.jsonl   text eol=lf
*.json    text eol=lf
*.txt     text eol=lf
*.sh      text eol=lf
*.sbatch  text eol=lf
*.py      text eol=lf
*.md      text eol=lf
*.env     text eol=lf
